{
  "bookId": "rewind-6",
  "id": "chapter-30",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3970001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3970002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "来啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3970003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "用你们的正义打到我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3970004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "用你们跟主人的羁绊将那个人类召唤此地，踩碎我啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3970005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你这家伙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3970006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我们……根本不是对手的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3970007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "注定要……失败了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3970008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我……好、好不甘心啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-213",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3970001,
            3970002,
            3970003,
            3970004,
            3970005,
            3970006,
            3970007,
            3970008
          ],
          "sectionId": 3970
        }
      ],
      "title": "#1 复仇的欲望"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "3980001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "和江！请……请振作一点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "我们……毫无胜算。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我……我会跟大家一起抵挡，花迦……拜托你，去找主人帮忙吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "前辈……这是不可能的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真的……没有任何胜算了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真田幸村",
          "text": "可恶，我……我还没输呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "下一个。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿撒兹勒",
          "text": "是谁？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真的，没有任何可能了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不，那些回忆，那些回忆里，一定有打败他的方法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是，这也就意味着，身体上本来所剩无几的涂料，会再次减少。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "每一寸涂料，都是优纪跟主人之间……那些最美好的回忆。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "对不起……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "3980014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我做不到……对不起，我做不到！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-214",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
          "rowIds": [
            3980001,
            3980002,
            3980003,
            3980004,
            3980005,
            3980006,
